  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><color=#FBBF24>THE IDEA</color></b>

    You are the parking manager.
    Parked cars are a fleet''s <b>Allocation</b>, cars on the street its <b>Need</b>,
    cars at the gate the <b>Request</b>, and empty bays are <b>Available</b>.

    <b>GRANT</b>
    only if every fleet could still finish afterwards (a safe sequence exists).


    <b><color=#FBBF24>CONTROLS</color></b>

    <b>GRANT</b>
    / <b>DENY</b> on the board, the side panel or the card above the gate, then <b>NEXT</b>.

    Five
    guided levels, then endless challenges with a speed bonus.


    <b>Desktop</b> 
    right-drag to orbit, scroll to zoom.

    <b>Headset</b>  left stick walk, right
    stick turn (push up to teleport). Look at a controller to see its buttons.

    <b>Hands</b> 
    point + pinch to select; pinch the ground and release to teleport; pinch + flick
    sideways to turn; left palm up for MENU.'
